🏫 School Management System

A web-based School Management System built to simplify student, teacher, class, and academic record management.

🚀 Features

- 🔐 Admin Login & Authentication
- 👨‍🎓 Student Management
- 👨‍🏫 Teacher Management
- 🏫 Class & Subject Management
- 📊 Admin Dashboard
- 🗄️ MySQL Database
- ✏️ CRUD Operations

🛠️ Tech Stack

- Frontend: HTML, CSS, JavaScript, Bootstrap
- Backend: PHP
- Database: MySQL
- Server: XAMPP / Apache

⚙️ Setup

1. Clone the repository.
2. Place the project inside "htdocs".
3. Start Apache and MySQL in XAMPP.
4. Create a MySQL database and import the provided ".sql" file.
5. Configure the database connection.
6. Open:

http://localhost/school-management-system/

📂 Main Modules

Admin
 ├── Students
 ├── Teachers
 ├── Classes
 ├── Subjects
 └── Dashboard

🎯 Objective

To provide a centralized digital platform for managing essential school records and reducing manual administrative work.

